  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Pine Billy**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Old Farmer's Mill**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Ain't Gonna Work Tomorrow**: rare: 6 archived performances [2]\n- **Bottom Of The Sea**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Treat Me So Bad**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Heavy Rain**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Watching The Detectives**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Mysterio**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: Jam, Groundhog [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **cabinet2016-06-10.schoepsMK21.sbd.flac16** (recommended): matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 21 songs; 139 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Billy Strings performed as a special guest on acoustic and electric guitar all night [1]\n- Todd Kopec was absent from the performance due to his daughter's high school graduation [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **cabinet2016-06-10.schoepsMK21.sbd.flac16**: taped by Keith Litzenberger; transferred by Keith Litzenberger; source: SBD+Schoeps MK21's>SD788t [1]. Also: Keith Litzenberger recorded the show using a soundboard and Schoeps MK21 microphones [1]",
